xournal-sharp (1.4.1~gtk4-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Open Saber notes (.sba) and export to Saber: strokes with pressure,
    highlighter, images, PDF backgrounds, background patterns and typed text.
  * Save files as format version 4 when possible, so that Xournal++ 1.3 opens
    them without warning.

