xournal-sharp (1.4.0~gtk4-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First release of Xournal# on GTK 4 and libadwaita (based on the Xournal++
    GTK 4 port by Benjamin Hennion).
  * libadwaita window, header bar and alert dialogs; accent colour for the page
    border and selections; sidebar, zoom bar and colour palette in GNOME style.
  * Own name, icon and settings; installs alongside the regular Xournal++.
  * Fix PDF export of links with non-ASCII URLs.

